      "text": "PEARSON SPECTER LITT - TITLE REVIEW PACKET\nMatter No: PSL-2026-0142\nClient: Ridge Harbor Capital LLC\nSeller: West 46th Street Holdings, Inc.\nBuyer: Ridge Harbor Capital LLC\nProperty: 1188 West 46th Street, New York, NY\n\nTitle Commitment dated April 24, 2026\nClosing target: May 20, 2026\nPurchase price: $18,400,000.00\n\nSchedule B - Exceptions\n1. Taxes for calendar year 2026 are not yet due and payable.\n2. Utility easement recorded in Liber 4102, Page 778 affects the rear five feet of the parcel.\n3. Mortgage satisfaction for prior lender appears pending; payoff letter references File No: LND-88-204.\n4. [illegible] handwritten notation beside exception 7 appears to reference \"roof access\" but the scanned copy is unclear.",
